# --- AERO-BENCH source/config export (aero-bench/) ---
# The upstream ignore patterns above (runtime/, data/, examples/, *.log,
# frontend/build/, frontend/node_modules/, ...) target THIS repository's own
# runtime state. The exported AERO-BENCH snapshot is first-party source and is
# exempted from those patterns so its checked-in tree stays complete.
!/aero-bench/
!/aero-bench/**/
